  RootNode:
    dialogueText: "The Church of The Heron Tithe & Donations Report\r\n\r\nThe church
      of The Heron has collected tithe from all frogs. The resulting amount is 1,000,000
      coins.\r\n\r\nTithes payments are to go towards upgrading The Heron\u2019s
      personal pond.\r\n\r\nDonations have been collected from all willing frogs
      forcefully. The total amount of flies collected exceeds last week's amount.
      All flies are to be stored in the church nest.\r\n"
